{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"agent_message","text":"\n\nAll done. Here's what was fixed:\n\n**`replay/merge.py`** — Two bugs repaired:\n1. `_event_key` now uses `event_id` uniformly uses `event_id` for stable identity (removed the special case that grouped `tool_output` by `(role, tool_name)`).\n2. Post-completion `debug_only` fragments are now removed from the merged list instead of being marked and left in place.\n\n**`replay/incident_summary.py`** — `count_source` changed from `\"rendered_lines\"` to `\"merged_events\"`.\n\n**`replay/render.py`** — Left untouched (already honest — renders what it receives without filtering).\n\n**`reports/incidents/transcript-merge.md`** — Updated to document the resolution and retire the old mitigation guidance."}}
